The current engine uses atlas sprites and an event bus. I’m keeping behavior in the registry callbacks and pooling the telegraph meshes. Boss attacks will lock their target lanes when the warning starts and leave a neighboring lane open; Scrap Colossus will spawn two damageable halves at 50% HP.

